    "show_share": true,
    "description": "This was\nheld successfully on July 16, 2018. The aim was to spread awareness about the latest\ntechniques in treating orbital cancer. 60 participants attended this multidisciplinary\nscientific programme organised by AKU Ophthalmology in collaboration with\nRadiation and Paediatric Oncology departments.",
